    "title": "Trucks Remove Asphalt from (Sand Mining) Zibell Farm - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By The Town Common ,\n18 hours ago GEORGETOWN − The neighbors and town officials continued last week to be at odds over the removal of ground asphalt from the 100-year-old Zibell Farm here. Meanwhile, the Salem District Court ordered the former farm manager to pay almost $4,000 by October to settle charges that he committed larceny, lied and forged the farm owner’s name on documents. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
